  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a Data Sharing Framework for Kenya&#x2019;s Space Sector</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to improve data accessibility, usability, and build trust in data quality within the space sector through the development of a data sharing framework. The initiative will support the development of frameworks and practices that ensure data is not only available but also reliable and actionable for decision-making.</narrative>
